# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization.
#
# eol=lf makes the working tree LF on every platform, not just the stored blob.
# Without it a Windows checkout converts to CRLF, which then disagrees with the
# end_of_line setting in .editorconfig and fails the formatting check on CI while
# passing on Linux. Development happens on both, so the working tree has to agree
# with itself across them.
#
# No file content changes: text=auto already normalised everything to LF in the
# repository. This only settles what lands on disk at checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf
